@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home";
}

<header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="hero-subtitle">Hear the Call of the Hollow</p>
        <h1 class="hero-title shimmer-text">Hollowbourn</h1>
        <p class="hero-edition">A 2D MMORPG</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">
            Beyond the threshold of Aelunis lies a realm watched by six gods, claimed by three
            rival powers, and haunted by a mystery no scholar has named. Cross over. Choose your
            allegiance. Learn what waits for those marked by the Hollow.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#download" class="btn btn-primary">Claim the Client</a>
            <a href="#about" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the Tome</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="about" class="section section-dark">
    <div class="section-inner section-narrow">
        <p class="section-label">The Premise</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">What Is Hollowbourn?</h2>
        <div class="ornament-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p>
            Hollowbourn is a 2D MMORPG built around the <strong>Hollow-touched</strong>: souls
            marked in the instant they crossed out of Aelunis and into the mortal realm. Where an
            ordinary life would end, theirs does not. Something pulls them into the Hollow instead,
            a realm caught between what is and what comes after, and from there, if they are strong
            enough, they return.
        </p>
        <p>
            Six gods watch this world. Three powers (the Crown, the Rival, and the Discord) divide
            its towns and its loyalties. And beneath all of it waits a seventh name no one living
            can speak, because no one living knows it.
        </p>
        <div class="section-cta">
            <a asp-page="/Pantheon" class="btn btn-secondary">Meet the Pantheon</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-dark">
    <div class="section-inner">
        <p class="section-label">The Realm</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">A Kingdom Divided</h2>
        <div class="ornament-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card reveal-up">
                <h3>Calren</h3>
                <p>Seat of the Crown. Proud and ceremonial, it faces the sea as though daring it to approach.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card reveal-up">
                <h3>Grivastel</h3>
                <p>Home of the Rival. Hard iron, harder grudges, and a debt the Crown has never settled.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card reveal-up">
                <h3>Kelgrim</h3>
                <p>Carved from the bones of the Kraghold. The Discord's stronghold, and no friend to those above.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="download" class="section section-dark">
    <div class="section-inner section-narrow">
        <p class="section-label">Join the Adventure</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Download Hollowbourn</h2>
        <div class="ornament-divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p>
            The client is not yet ready to be unsealed. Return to this page when the threshold opens.
        </p>
        <div class="section-cta">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" aria-disabled="true">Sealed for Now</a>
        </div>
        <p class="download-note">No client is available yet. This marks where the download will appear.</p>
    </div>
</section>
